<title>USA: Lyondell Petrochemical Q3 shr falls to $0.43.</title>
<headline>Lyondell Petrochemical Q3 shr falls to $0.43.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.43		    $1.25</p>
<p> Net		 35,000		   100,000</p>
<p> Revs		1,247,000		1,249,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  80,000		   80,000</p>
<p>			  Nine months</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.92		    $4.52</p>
<p> Net		 74,000		   362,000</p>
<p> Revs		3,651,000		3,793,000</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  80,000		   80,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said a fire this year in its ARCO Pipe Line system that forced it to shut its Channelview Petrochemical Complex for two weeks caused a $20 million after-tax loss equal to $0.25 per share.</p>
</text>
